Connect receiving observations to the material that will be used (@cs-receiving: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @chemical-supply-systems, #source "../sources/Pharmaceutical-Starting-Materials-WHO.lingua#r_7H51215T44S69TD3R0499VMTTY", #source "../sources/Warehouse-and-Distribution-Science.lingua#r_1QVYHWFDZJB0PMG6V9CB2M4H10", #source "../sources/Chemical-Warehousing-HSE-HSG71.lingua#r_6MKP347GP6BY1H1PCKCJKAV91R", #chemical-supply-systems "../../../../inquiry/metrology/foundations/Sampling-and-representativeness.lingua#r_0F0VEC42GPQPRZM0S7MXF7GAEH") { r_6TX7C86D26AMZDW2V07MYVJ8NZ
**Read:** [Good trade and distribution practices for pharmaceutical starting materials — WHO](../sources/Pharmaceutical-Starting-Materials-WHO.lingua#r_7H51215T44S69TD3R0499VMTTY), complete procurement, equipment, documentation and transport sections; [Warehouse & Distribution Science — Bartholdi and Hackman](../sources/Warehouse-and-Distribution-Science.lingua#r_1QVYHWFDZJB0PMG6V9CB2M4H10), the complete receiving, material-flow and information-system chapters; [Chemical warehousing — HSE HSG71](../sources/Chemical-Warehousing-HSE-HSG71.lingua#r_6MKP347GP6BY1H1PCKCJKAV91R), the complete storage/facility and operating-review discussion.

A delivery can be present without being accepted or available for use. Follow the actual sequence of arrival, identity/quantity checks, package or equipment observations, representative sampling, analysis and disposition. Some products or arrangements allow justified reliance on qualified-supplier evidence; others need new measurements. State the basis of the decision and who controls it.

For a package delivery identify the lot and package count. For a bulk delivery identify the vehicle/compartment, previous contents evidence where relevant, transfer destination and receiving tank state. Do not mix an unresolved delivery into existing accepted stock merely to simplify the paper account: mixing changes the material represented and can spread uncertainty or nonconformity.

Draw the physical and information paths through receiving, quarantine and release. Include time, available space, testing equipment, trained work and a response to a mismatched document or quantity. Compare what can be observed before unloading with what becomes known only after sampling. Develop a receiving case using real product documents, with hypothetical observation data clearly labelled. The goal is to understand how an organization's accepted usable inventory differs from gross stock on site and from the quantity printed on a purchasing order.

**Continue:** [A specimen, a sampling target, and a result about a population](../../../../inquiry/metrology/foundations/Sampling-and-representativeness.lingua#r_0F0VEC42GPQPRZM0S7MXF7GAEH).

